$ Fe-V B2_221 CALPHAD Model
$ TDB-file for the thermodynamic assessment of the Fe-V system
$ with B2 ordered phase modeled using 8 sublattices (2x2x1 supercell)
$
$-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
$ 2026.02.24
$ 
$ TDB file created based on CALPHAD-NK methodology
$ Using Neumann-Kopp approximation for temperature dependence
$
$ Reference: Sanchez et al., Phys. Rev. B 54, 8958 (1996)
$ Reference: Sanchez et al.
$ "Experimental and theoretical determination
$ of the metastable Fe-V phase diagram"
$
$ Base parameters from:
$ K.C. Hari Kumar and V. Raghavan, CALPHAD Vol. 15, No. 3, pp. 307-314, 1991
$
$ DFT reference energies (this work):
$ E_Fe_ref = -8.260986705 eV/atom (BCC Fe, DFT)
$ E_V_ref  = -8.9516726475 eV/atom (BCC V, DFT)
$
$-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
$
 ELEMENT /-   ELECTRON_GAS              0.0000E+00  0.0000E+00  0.0000E+00 !
 ELEMENT FE   BCC_A2                    5.5847E+01  4.4890E+03  2.7280E+01 !
 ELEMENT V    BCC_A2                    5.0941E+01  4.5070E+03  3.0890E+01 !
 ELEMENT VA   VACUUM                    0.0000E+00  0.0000E+00  0.0000E+00 !
